OL,3,ALaptop catches fire on US flight, with
OL,4,Apassenger treated at airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has received medical
OL,7,Ftreatment after a passenger's laptop
OL,8,Fcaught fire on an American Airlines
OL,9,Fflight.
OL,11,FThe pilot had reported a "cabin fire in
OL,12,Fthe back of the airplane" to air
OL,13,Ftraffic control, saying "the flight
OL,14,Fattendants are trying to put it out
OL,15,Fnow", according to audio obtained by
OL,16,Fthe BBC's US reporting partner CBS
OL,17,FNews.
OL,19,F"I think we have about four to five
OL,20,Fpassengers that were burned by the
OL,21,Flaptop. The laptop is contained about
OL,22,Fmid-aircraft."
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
