OL,3,ALaptop catches fire on US flight, with
OL,4,Apassenger treated at airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne passenger received medical
OL,7,Fattention on site and was released
OL,8,Fafter American Airlines Flight 2398 -
OL,9,Fcoming from Atlanta, Georgia - landed
OL,10,Fat Dallas Fort Worth International
OL,11,FAirport in Texas on Friday.
